  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional The Alchemist's Study – A Magical Diorama. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files please visit the The Alchemist's Study – A Magical Diorama on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Overview</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>The Alchemist's Study – A Magical Diorama</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<!--Overview部分（无需改动）-->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<!--创作者计划注释（无需改动）-->\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\">To download the model files please visit the <strong>The Alchemist's Study – A Magical Diorama</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/2951017-the-alchemist-s-study-a-magical-diorama?from=search#profileId-3306437\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">MakerWorld</span></strong></span></a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">In The Box</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse; height: 75px;\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; height: 25px;\"><strong>Item Name</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px; width: 20%; height: 25px;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><!--商品信息Code粘贴起始位置-->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px; height: 50px;\">\n<div class=\"hover-img-container\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><a href=\"../../products/m2-5-button-head-cap-machine-screws-bhcs-1?id=48671486476636\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">M2.5x6 BHCS Machine Screw (20PCS) - AA050</a></strong></span></p>\n<img class=\"hover-img product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.eu/s8/default/07fca6c862d44080953687665261e2ab/Group_1123860874_34b66fe7-5d3f-4e0f-b838-012fbe9816fa.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px; height: 50px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px; height: 50px;\">\n<div class=\"hover-img-container\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><a href=\"../../products/m2-socket-head-cap-machine-screws-shcs?id=48672758956380\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">M2x5 SHCS Machine Screw (20PCS) - AA150</a></strong></span></p>\n<img class=\"hover-img product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white a